   "premise": "In the Neon Phantom Library, a glowing adventurer navigates a sprawling haunted maze filled with spectral orbs to collect. Ghostly librarians patrol intensely, requiring careful and strategic movement. Use temporary power-ups to outwit these spirits in a neon-lit pixel art world that's spooky yet playful and steadily paced.",
